  "title": "Global-e to Announce Financial Results for the Second Quarter 2026 on August 12, 2026",
  "summary": "PETAH-TIKVA, Israel, July 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Global-e Online Ltd. (Nasdaq: GLBE), the global e-commerce enablement platform, today announced it will report financial results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2026, before market open on Wednesday, August 12, 2026.",
